      "title": "The Importance of Breakfast",
      "text": "Many people believe that breakfast is the most important meal of the day. Research suggests that eating a healthy morning meal can (1) ______ your energy levels and help you focus better at work or school. However, skipping breakfast is a common habit for those who are (2) ______ for time in the morning. Instead of grabbing a sugary snack, it is better to choose something nutritious like porridge or fruit. These foods provide the vitamins your body (3) ______ to function properly. If you find it difficult to eat early, try preparing something the night before. Making small changes to your daily (4) ______ can have a positive impact on your long-term health. It is also important to stay (5) ______ by drinking plenty of water throughout the day. Remember, healthy eating is not about strict rules, but about making better (6) ______ for your body.",
